abstract: "P3IF (Properties, Processes, Perspectives Inter-Framework) in Python — compose and validate requirements patterns across security, healthcare, and cognitive-security domains, then explore them through 3D interactive visualizations and a Flask dashboard. Pydantic models, synthetic data generators, pytest suite."
